<title>USA: Horizon/CMS buying Pacific Rehabilitation.</title>
<headline>Horizon/CMS buying Pacific Rehabilitation.</headline>
<dateline>ALBUQUERQUE, N.M. 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Horizon/CMS Healthcare Corp said it has a definitive merger agreement to buy Pacific Rehabilitation &amp; Sports Medicine Inc for $6.50 per share in cash.</p>
<p>Following the completion of the offer and subject to the terms and conditions set forth in the deal, any shares of common stock not purchased in the tender offer would be acquired at the same price in a cash merger.</p>
<p>Horizon said it plans to begin the offer no later than November 22.  </p>
<p>Consummation of the tender offer and the merger are conditioned upon, among other things, the valid tender of a majority of the outstanding common shares of Pacific Rehabilitation.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
